WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:05.312
Open Borders, Closed Services: Canada's Immigration System Failure.

00:00:05.262 --> 00:00:07.937
Canada is an immigrant nation.

00:00:07.937 --> 00:00:14.200
Our grandfathers came through Pier 21 with nothing but determination and a name on a manifest.

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:18.987
They built the railroads, harvested the prairies, manned the convoys.

00:00:18.987 --> 00:00:22.175
The system worked — because it was managed .

00:00:22.175 --> 00:00:25.087
There were targets tied to capacity.

00:00:25.087 --> 00:00:27.262
Housing was affordable.

00:00:27.262 --> 00:00:29.512
Hospitals had beds.

00:00:29.512 --> 00:00:31.725
Schools had desks.
